  "published": "2026-02-08T10:07:38.86Z",
  "readmeFile": "Readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "... more functionalities for Sigma Drone Chart\n1. Interactive dipsplay.  To improve the display on the map, charts can be displayed at a smaller size and transparency. When the mouse cursor is over the chart, the graphs are displayed without transparency and at normal size.\n2. Evenimente pentru Sigma Drone Chart: OnClick, OnDoubleClick, OnMouseDown and OnMouseUp\n3. haloText for SigmaDroneCrownDiscrete, SigmaDroneCrownPercent\n4. Customizing the style of chart elements using CSS\n- Sigma Drone backgorund -> sector of Sigma Drone circle\n- Sigma Drone pivot -> the point where the Sigma Drone is hung\n4.a. Sigma Drone Crown Scale\n- Sigma Drone Crown Scale ticks - ticks of scale\n- Sigma Drone Crown Scale indicator- indicator of scale\n4.b. Sigma Drone Crown Discrete \n- Sigma Drone Crown Discrete indicator- indicator of scale",
  "repository": "",
